From a320072ed5719fe78141a8bd97f7a1a57c89af42 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 13:40:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Derive contract return-on-capital, coverage, turnover and
 QoQ metrics

Adds deterministic formulas for 23 factory-contract keys that the
calculator never produced although their inputs are already ingested:
NOPAT, ROIC, return on capital, ROCE, incremental ROIC, margin expansion,
fixed-asset and working-capital turnover, inventory to revenue, return on
tangible assets, CFO interest, debt-service and fixed-charge coverage,
revenue and FCF per-share growth, and eight quarter-on-quarter changes
keyed by fiscal quarter. Balance denominators average the opening and
closing year-end balances; nothing is emitted unless every input exists.
Formula lineage is registered in calculation_definitions.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CfTpoii6QDStyTPdotmEdY
