Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Emit no NOPAT or after-tax returns for a loss year

A negative pre-tax income turns abs(tax) / pretax into a negative rate
and inflates NOPAT; the tax rate is now undefined unless pretax > 0.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CfTpoii6QDStyTPdotmEdY
